    "title": "Connect remote enrollment HTTP",
    "version": "connect-enrollment/1",
    "description": "Implemented HTTP component and Store contract. The legacy loopback HTTP listener exposes the same bounded routes for local use. Remote use requires explicit HTTPS hosting and trusted certificates. Actual browser/native client setup and transport-bound use of issued credentials remain separate G6-055 work; schema generation alone is not runtime qualification."
